//! # polaris-proto
//!
//! Protobuf contracts and generated tonic/prost code for the kernel, worker and guest services
//! (layer L1, phase P1), plus shared bounded wire validation and worker credential contracts.
//! Transport ownership (named pipe, TCP with mTLS) belongs to `polaris-rpc` and the apps.
//!
//! | Item | Contents |
//! |---|---|
//! | `proto/polaris/v1/*.proto` | `common`, `kernel`, `worker`, `guest`: package `polaris.v1` |
//! | [`generated`] / [`pb`] | prost messages and tonic clients / servers, generated by `build.rs` with the vendored `protoc` |
//! | [`FILE_DESCRIPTOR_SET`] | the serialized `FileDescriptorSet` (schema introspection, golden checks) |
//! | [`PROTOCOL_VERSION`], [`negotiate`] | version constant and the major-must-match handshake rule |
//! | [`limits`] | the 1 MiB message / 896 KiB chunk guard (PLAN pitfall W22) |
//! | `TryFrom` / `From` impls | fallible, never-panicking conversions between sdk types and [`pb`] messages: `Event`, `EventRecord`, `Command<Unverified>`, `CommandBody`, `Decision`, `Question`, `DecisionInput` |
//!
//! ## Rules of the schema
//!
//! - Blobs travel as CAS references (`Cid`), never inline; the only inline `bytes` are the
//!   capability token and stream chunks of at most [`limits::MAX_CHUNK_BYTES`].
//! - Every enum has an `*_UNSPECIFIED = 0` value which decoders reject.
//! - Removed fields keep their number in a `reserved` statement; growing messages reserve
//!   `100 to 199`.
//! - An approval witness never crosses the wire: pb -> sdk always yields `Command<Unverified>`.
//!
//! ## Build
//!
//! `build.rs` needs neither a system `protoc` nor network access: it uses the `protoc` binary and the
//! well-known-type includes of `protoc-bin-vendored`, and writes to `OUT_DIR` only.
//!
//! Test-first descriptors: `specs/descriptors/proto_*.json`.

mod convert;
mod error;
pub mod limits;
mod version;
pub mod worker_auth;

pub use error::ProtoError;
pub use version::{PROTOCOL_VERSION, ProtocolVersion, negotiate};

/// Code generated by `build.rs` from `proto/polaris/v1/*.proto` (do not edit; it lives in `OUT_DIR`).
pub mod generated {
    /// Namespace of the protobuf package `polaris`.
    pub mod polaris {
        /// Protobuf package `polaris.v1`: messages, enums, and the tonic clients / servers of
        /// `PolarisKernelService`, `WorkerService` and `GuestService`.
        pub mod v1 {
            include!(concat!(env!("OUT_DIR"), "/polaris.v1.rs"));
        }
    }
}

pub use generated::polaris::v1 as pb;

/// The serialized `google.protobuf.FileDescriptorSet` of all `polaris.v1` files (with imports).
pub const FILE_DESCRIPTOR_SET: &[u8] =
    include_bytes!(concat!(env!("OUT_DIR"), "/polaris_v1_descriptor.bin"));
